"""Java Backend track (30 weeks). Mon-Sat, 60 min each; Saturday = BUILD, or BOSS BATTLE in boss weeks (W4, W9, W15, W20, W25, W30).
Session method: 10 min recap/predict -> 15 min learn (one main resource) -> up to 35 min hands-on (type it, modify it, then write it
from scratch); anything that does not fit goes to the week's stretch.
Repos: `java-mastery` (W1-W12, one package or module per week, JUnit tests from W2) and `ticketverse` (W13-W30).
Environment: company laptop (Corretto 25 for learning, IntelliJ, Maven via company JFrog); Docker from W11 with images through the
company's Docker mirror in JFrog (Codespace fallback); kubectl + kind from W23; LLM calls only in Codespaces.
All links verified Oct 2026."""

